  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6163, eff 1-4-96, EXPIRED: 1-4-04 New. #8732, eff 9-30-06; ss by #10810, eff 4-9-15; ss by #14393, eff 10-1-25, EXPIRES: 10-1-35",
